tle":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[64,63,45,46,30,33],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[64,63,45,46,30,33],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1052","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[64,63,45,46,30,33],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10064","city":"CS1051","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[64,63,45,46,30,33],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"3600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1008405","helmet":"WP1023305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"袁术部将，原为庐江太守。被袁术任命为庐江太守，袁术死后，拥兵自立于庐江。因兵力强盛且粮草不足，被孙策、周瑜的“上缭之谋”所骗，率主力南下攻打上缭。孙策趁机派兵从背后偷袭其大本营皖城，刘勋根基尽失。失地后，率残部北上归附曹操，被封为征虏将军、河内太守等职。因与魏讽谋反案有牵连，被曹操之子曹丕处死。","tc":"袁術部將，原為廬江太守。被袁術任命為廬江太守，袁術死后，擁兵自立于廬江。因兵力強盛且糧草不足，被孫策、周瑜的“上繚之謀”所騙，率主力南下攻打上繚。孫策趁機派兵從背后偷襲其大本營皖城，劉勛根基盡失。失地后，率殘部北上歸附曹操，被封為征虜將軍、河內太守等職。因與魏諷謀反案有牽連，被曹操之子曹丕處死。","en":"A subordinate of Yuan Shu and former Governor of Lujiang. Appointed by Yuan Shu as Governor of Lujiang, he established himself as an independent force after Yuan Shu's death. Commanding substantial forces but short on provisions, he was deceived by Sun Ce and Zhou Yu's ‘Shangliao stratagem’. He led his main army south to attack Shangliao, whereupon Sun Ce dispatched troops to strike his main camp at Wan City from behind, destroying his power base. After losing his territory, he led his remaining forces north to join Cao Cao, receiving appointments as General Who Conquers Captives and Governor of Henei. He was later implicated in Wei Feng's conspiracy and was executed by Cao Cao's son Cao Pi.","jp":"袁術の部将。もとは廬江太守。袁術により廬江太守に任じられ、袁術の死後は兵を擁して廬江で自立した。兵力は強大であったが兵糧が不足していたため、孫策と周瑜の「上繚の計」に欺かれ、主力を率いて南下し上繚を攻めた。孫策はその機に乗じて背後から本拠地の皖城を奇襲し、劉勲は根拠地をすべて失った。領地を失った後は残部を率いて北上し曹操に帰順、征虜将軍や河内太守などに任じられた。後に魏諷の謀反事件に連座し、曹操の子である曹丕によって処刑された。","kr":"원술의 부하 장수로 본래 여강태수였다. 원술에게 여강태수로 임명되었으며, 원술 사후에는 여강에서 병력을 이끌고 자립했다. 병력은 강성했으나 군량이 부족하여 손책과 주유의 '상료의 계책'에 속았고, 주력을 이끌고 남하하여 상료를 공격했다. 손책이 그 틈을 타 배후에서 본거지인 완성을 기습하자 근거지를 모조리 잃고 말았다. 영지를 잃은 뒤 잔여 병력을 이끌고 북상하여 조조에게 귀부하였으며, 정로장군과 하내태수 등의 직책에 봉해졌다. 이후 위풍의 반역 사건에 연루되어 조조의 아들 조비에게 처형되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10558","remark":"","surname":"刘","surnameTc":"劉","surnameEn":"Liu","surnameJp":"劉","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"勋","nameTc":"勛","nameEn":"Xun","nameJp":"勲","nameKr":"훈","nameOther":"","word":"子台","wordTc":"子臺","wordEn":"Zitai","wordJp":"子台","wordKr":"자대","wordOther":"","icon":"刘勋","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1052","gender":"0","rule":"64","force":"63","wise":"45","politics":"46","charm":"30","will":"33","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"1","weaponMaster":"18/18/59/18/18/8/50/18","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","deba